Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Splice-Mark on the Dead Letter
- Story & Context: In the subterranean rewinding bay of the Scala Cinema, projectionist Arthur Vance intercepted a damp parcel postmarked from 1929 containing blank film addressed to a long-dead theater manager. Threading the brittle film through the sputtering carbon arc, Arthur pounded an iron-weighted mallet into a dented steel pan to mirror the projector's motor, furiously chugging an E-minor thrash riff as burning celluloid dust began filling his throat. When the fragile strip jammed and threatened to ignite the booth in a chemical fire, Vance refused to engage the emergency brake, screaming down the speaking tube, "Read the envelope before the room catches fire."
